+/// **One damaged object does not end the walk.** A record that will not decode, or a
+/// generation the resolver cannot read on a root that still names it
+/// ([`ChunkMapError`]), marks the reading incomplete and the walk goes on, so every other
+/// obligation is still answered. `Ok(None)` — no live committed generation left under the
